{
  "id": "JHN.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "John 12",
  "verseCount": 46,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus therefore six days before the passover came to Bethany, where Lazarus was, whom Jesus raised from the dead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they made him a supper there: and Martha served; but Lazarus was one of them that sat at meat with him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mary therefore took a pound of ointment of pure nard, very precious, and anointed the feet of Jesus, and wiped his feet with her hair: and the house was filled with the odor of the ointment. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Judas Iscariot, one of his disciples, that should betray him, saith, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why was not this ointment sold for three hundred shillings, and given to the poor? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now this he said, not because he cared for the poor; but because he was a thief, and having the bag took away what was put therein. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus therefore said, Suffer her to keep it against the day of my burying. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the poor ye have always with you; but me ye have not always.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The common people therefore of the Jews learned that he was there: and they came, not for Jesus’ sake only, but that they might see Lazarus also, whom he had raised from the dead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the chief priests took counsel that they might put Lazarus also to death; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because that by reason of him many of the Jews went away, and believed on Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the morrow a great multitude that had come to the feast, when they heard that Jesus was coming to Jerusalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "took the branches of the palm trees, and went forth to meet him, and cried out, Hosanna: Blessed ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " he that cometh in the name of the Lord, even the King of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus, having found a young ass, sat thereon; as it is written, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fear not, daughter of Zion: behold, thy King cometh, sitting on an ass’s colt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These things understood not his disciples at the first: but when Jesus was glorified, then remembered they that these things were written of him, and that they had done these things unto him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The multitude therefore that was with him when he called Lazarus out of the tomb, and raised him from the dead, bare witness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For this cause also the multitude went and met him, for that they heard that he had done this sign. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Pharisees therefore said among themselves, Behold how ye prevail nothing; lo, the world is gone after him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now there were certain Greeks among those that went up to worship at the feast: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "these therefore came to Philip, who was of Bethsaida of Galilee, and asked him, saying, Sir, we would see Jesus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Philip cometh and telleth Andrew: Andrew cometh, and Philip, and they tell Jesus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus answereth them, saying, The hour is come, that the Son of man should be glorified. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Verily, verily, I say unto you, Except a grain of wheat fall into the earth and die, it abideth by itself alone; but if it die, it beareth much fruit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that loveth his life loseth it; and he that hateth his life in this world shall keep it unto life eternal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If any man serve me, let him follow me; and where I am, there shall also my servant be: if any man serve me, him will the Father honor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now is my soul troubled; and what shall I say? Father, save me from this hour. But for this cause came I unto this hour. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Father, glorify thy name. There came therefore a voice out of heaven, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", I have both glorified it, and will glorify it again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The multitude therefore, that stood by, and heard it, said that it had thundered: others said, An angel hath spoken to him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered and said, This voice hath not come for my sake, but for your sakes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now is the judgment of this world: now shall the prince of this world be cast out. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I, if I be lifted up from the earth, will draw all men unto myself. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But this he said, signifying by what manner of death he should die. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The multitude therefore answered him, We have heard out of the law that the Christ abideth for ever: and how sayest thou, The Son of man must be lifted up? who is this Son of man? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus therefore said unto them, Yet a little while is the light among you. Walk while ye have the light, that darkness overtake you not: and he that walketh in the darkness knoweth not whither he goeth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While ye have the light, believe on the light, that ye may become sons of light.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These things spake Jesus, and he departed and hid himself from them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But though he had done so many signs before them, yet they believed not on him: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that the word of Isaiah the prophet might be fulfilled, which he spake,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus cried and said, He that believeth on me, believeth not on me, but on him that sent me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he that beholdeth me beholdeth him that sent me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am come a light into the world, that whosoever believeth on me may not abide in the darkness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if any man hear my sayings, and keep them not, I judge him not: for I came not to judge the world, but to save the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that rejecteth me, and receiveth not my sayings, hath one that judgeth him: the word that I spake, the same shall judge him in the last day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I spake not from myself; but the Father that sent me, he hath given me a commandment, what I should say, and what I should speak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I know that his commandment is life eternal; the things therefore which I speak, even as the Father hath said unto me, so I speak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
